# ⚠️ STRICT PROTOCOL: READ SKILLS BEFORE EXECUTION (SKILL-FIRST RULE)

All AI agents working on this codebase MUST strictly follow the "Skill-First Protocol." Do not generate any code, make layout modifications, write configurations, or run scripts without first reading the corresponding instruction manual.

## 🔄 Mandatory 3-Step Workflow

1. **DISCOVER**: Identify which skill(s) inside the `.agents/skills/` directory are relevant to the requested task.
2. **READ (Prerequisite)**: Execute the `view_file` tool on the relevant `SKILL.md` file BEFORE writing any code.
3. **APPLY**: Write and execute all changes strictly conforming to the design standards, animations, templates, and constraints defined in those skills.

